#: patterns/faq.php:23
msgid "Do you charge for the site walk?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:24
msgid "No. The walk and the written quote are free, and there is no obligation to book."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:29
msgid "How is the work priced?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:30
msgid "By the job, itemised: materials, labour, delivery and disposal on separate lines. If we find something unexpected, we stop and talk to you before spending your money."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:35
msgid "Can you work around a tight budget?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:36
msgid "Yes. Most plans can be built in phases, so the patio comes this year and the planting next."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:41
msgid "What about permits?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:42
msgid "Walls over four feet and some drainage changes need one. We tell you at the quote stage whether your job does and who files it."
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:47
msgid "Is this a real company?"
msgstr ""

#: patterns/faq.php:48
msgid "No. Alderbend Landscape Co. is a made-up business used to show a WordPress theme. The towns, prices, phone number and projects are examples."
